ed in accordance with law\" for the election's suspension"},"c":{"zh":"用「暴衝」描述候選人的駕車事故","en":"Uses \"sudden acceleration\" to describe the candidate's crash"},"g":{"zh":"用「驚悚」形容五股騎樓車禍","en":"Calls the Wugu crash \"horrifying\""}},"diff":null,"m":19,"at":1794621281439},"11rdtv1":{"sides":{"b":{"zh":"引述藍營要求黃世傑「勿切割卸責」","en":"Quotes the blue camp demanding the candidate not \"distance himself and shirk responsibility\""},"c":{"zh":"以「音檔外流」交代失言曝光方式","en":"Uses \"leaked audio\" to explain how the remarks surfaced"},"g":{"zh":"引述議員稱沈伯洋「該道歉」","en":"Quotes a councillor saying Puma Shen \"should apologize\""}},"diff":null,"m":26,"at":1794549281439},"fypy7r":{"sides":{"g":{"zh":"引述家屬批評「司法迫害」","en":"Quotes the family alleging \"judicial persecution\""},"b":{"zh":"以「沒有候選人」形容競總大會","en":"Describes the campaign headquarters launch as \"without a candidate\""},"c":{"zh":"聚焦送禮發生於「選前1年」","en":"Focuses on gifts given \"1 year before the election\""}},"diff":{"zh":"只有中間標題以150元描述生吐司","en":"Only 中間 headlines put the bread's value at 150 yuan"},"m":15,"at":1794623081439},"1mv2xfq":{"sides":{"c":{"zh":"強調俄羅斯已同意歐洲加入談判","en":"Emphasizes Russia has agreed to include Europe in the talks"},"l":{"zh":"用「拖延時間」形容普丁在和談中的作法","en":"Describes Putin as \"playing for time\" in peace talks"},"r":{"zh":"引述梅爾茨要求川普別讓談判有「意外」","en":"Quotes Merz asking Trump for \"no surprises\" from Putin talks"}},"diff":{"zh":"只有中間標題問是否獲贈同款俄羅斯外套","en":"Only 中間 asks whether matching Russia jackets were gifted"},"m":66,"at":1794599681439},"p41sos":{"sides":{"l":{"zh":"聚焦伊朗相隔多時再襲美軍據點","en":"Highlights Iran’s first attack on a US military site in months"},"r":{"zh":"引述川普稱伊朗「政權正崩潰」","en":"Quotes Trump saying Iran’s \"regime is collapsing\""},"c":{"zh":"以「5種情境」分析無協議後續","en":"Presents \"5 scenarios\" for what follows without an Iran deal"}},"diff":{"zh":"只有偏右提及川普要范斯聚焦貪腐與犯罪","en":"Only 偏右 mentions Trump directing Vance to focus on corruption and crime; 偏左 and 中間 do not"},"m":52,"at":1794596681439},"1x8h8t6":{"sides":{"l":{"zh":"聚焦民主黨